      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: Here is a screenshot of the PCVR view, and a gif of how it looks on a Quest 3! Both players are in stations, and their station position is synced properly between the clients. When users are on the same platform (PCVR or Android), it properly locks both player positions to their stations. When seeing a user on a different platform, it seems to be using their global player position rather than their station position. This is why in the PCVR screenshot the Quest user is moving ahead, while the Quest POV gif shows the PCVR user falling behind.\n\nHere is a world ID that has the behaviour: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_03415963-883e-4510-9051-d142aeac65a5",
