      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not sure exactly why this has been marked as needs more information, as Im unsure what other information I could even provide. Players on different platforms are just not correctly attached to their stations, and are just using their own global position rather than being properly attached.\n\nHere is a video of what it looks like for a PCVR user when everyone else is on Quest: https://streamable.com/h0enkc",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
