      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "UPDATE\n\nThis is a problem that crops up when a station doesn't have an udonbehaviour attached to it. When a station doesn't have a behaviour attached, it automatically generates one. This is perfectly fine when on the same platform, but I believe that when on a different platform, the network IDs break, causing extremely weird issues. When having an udon behaviour attached to the station that is set to manual or continuous synced, there is already a consistent network ID assigned to that gameobject on both platforms, preventing the desync.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
