  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Within the past few weeks, stations seem to have broken, with players inside stations using their own positions rather than the station position when seen from a user on a different platform. This means that if a player on Quest is in a world with a player on PCVR, both players won't see eachother locked to their stations. This isn't a problem for users on the same platform.\n\nThis breaks any worlds that rely on stations overriding the player position for things like moving platforms.",
